import{_ as a,o as i,c as t,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const m=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 750 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | The Selfless-Dao Practice of Manual Openness","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 750 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | The Selfless-Dao Practice of Manual Openness","no":750,"module":4,"tags":["Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals","Selfless Dao","Manual Openness","Myriad-Rank Co-Build","Anti-Predation"],"related":["08-Everyone-a-Road Guarantee System","18-Cultivation-Resource Opening Mechanism","05-Myriad-Rank Common-Progress Basic Program"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0750_模块4-超多元级功法-无私道实践.md","filePath":"en/0750_模块4-超多元级功法-无私道实践.md"}'),n={name:"en/0750_模块4-超多元级功法-无私道实践.md"};function s(l,e,r,u,h,d){return i(),t("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-750-hyper-multiverse-grade-manuals-the-selfless-dao-practice-of-manual-openness" tabindex="-1">Entry 750 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | The Selfless-Dao Practice of Manual Openness <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-750-hyper-multiverse-grade-manuals-the-selfless-dao-practice-of-manual-openness" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 750 | Hyper-Multiverse-Grade Manuals | The Selfless-Dao Practice of Manual Openness&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 08, 18, 05</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-why-the-best-manuals-must-be-free" tabindex="-1">Introduction: why the best manuals must be free <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-why-the-best-manuals-must-be-free" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: why the best manuals must be free&quot;">​</a></h2><p>&quot;Selfless Dao&quot; is one of Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s core moral practices, and the anti-predation axiom&#39;s concrete landing in the knowledge domain. Its principle is simple: <strong>all knowledge, manuals, and technology beneficial to civilization must be network-wide free and open; no one may monopolize.</strong> This is not charity; this is civilizational safety — because knowledge monopoly inevitably leads to class solidification, and class solidification inevitably leads to predation.</p><p>Six top-level axioms here are the Selfless Dao&#39;s skeleton: the anti-predation axiom requires knowledge not be monopolized; the republican axiom of Myriad Races requires knowledge be open equally to all beings; the collective ascension axiom requires knowledge opening accelerate collective uplift; the causal self-discipline axiom requires knowledge propagation go through safe channels; the law-first axiom requires the &quot;Selfless Dao&quot; law itself be stably defined.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-the-old-system-s-three-knowledge-monopoly-modes" tabindex="-1">I. The Old System&#39;s Three Knowledge-Monopoly Modes <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-the-old-system-s-three-knowledge-monopoly-modes" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. The Old System&#39;s Three Knowledge-Monopoly Modes&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Before discussing Selfless-Dao practice, first see how the old system monopolized knowledge:</p><ol><li><strong>Sect monopoly</strong>: manuals only transmit within the sect; outsiders wanting to learn must take a master, and taking a master requires loyalty;</li><li><strong>Bloodline monopoly</strong>: manuals only transmit to specific bloodlines; outsiders, however strong, cannot learn;</li><li><strong>Chosen-one monopoly</strong>: manuals only transmit to &quot;the chosen son of Heaven&quot;; others are not even worthy of knowing.</li></ol><p>The three modes&#39; common result: knowledge becomes a tool of power; whoever holds knowledge holds the right to rule. 99% of Myriad Ranks&#39; beings are forever outside the door.</p><h2 id="ii-the-selfless-dao-s-five-practical-principles" tabindex="-1">II. The Selfless Dao&#39;s Five Practical Principles <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-selfless-dao-s-five-practical-principles" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Selfless Dao&#39;s Five Practical Principles&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Selfless Dao is not a slogan; it has five operable practical principles:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Principle</th><th>Content</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Full Publicity</td><td>All certified manuals are public in full text, no abridgment, no encryption</td></tr><tr><td>Zero Threshold</td><td>Learning requires no master, no fee, no loyalty</td></tr><tr><td>Improvable</td><td>Anyone may propose revisions to a manual; revisions are shared network-wide</td></tr><tr><td>Commercially Usable</td><td>Manuals may be used for commercial purposes, but commercial returns must feed back to civilization</td></tr><tr><td>Auditable</td><td>Manual usage data is network-wide queryable, preventing abuse</td></tr></tbody></table><p>The five principles together turn manuals from &quot;private property&quot; into &quot;public knowledge.&quot;</p><h2 id="iii-the-selfless-dao-s-operating-mechanism" tabindex="-1">III. The Selfless Dao&#39;s Operating Mechanism <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-selfless-dao-s-operating-mechanism" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Selfless Dao&#39;s Operating Mechanism&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Selfless Dao does not run on moral自觉; it has a whole set of operating mechanisms:</p><ul><li><strong>Filing means publicity</strong>: after a new manual passes the three gates, it auto-enters the Selfless-Dao public library;</li><li><strong>Contribution incentive</strong>: cultivators who open their manuals have their civilizational weight auto-increased (because they contributed to Myriad Ranks);</li><li><strong>Monopoly penalty</strong>: anyone found privately hoarding manuals without publicity has civilizational weight auto-deducted; severe cases lose cultivation qualification;</li><li><strong>Version management</strong>: the Selfless-Dao library has mature version management; every revision is recorded and traceable;</li><li><strong>Multi-language multi-species adaptation</strong>: manual documents auto-translate into Myriad-Rank languages, adapting to the five lineages&#39; reading habits.</li></ul><h2 id="iv-the-selfless-dao-s-relation-to-cultivators-personally" tabindex="-1">IV. The Selfless Dao&#39;s Relation to Cultivators Personally <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-the-selfless-dao-s-relation-to-cultivators-personally" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. The Selfless Dao&#39;s Relation to Cultivators Personally&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Someone may ask: I worked hard to create a manual; why must it be free? Why can&#39;t I make a living from it?</p><p>Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s answer:</p><ol><li><strong>Your innovation did not start from zero</strong>: you innovated standing on the shoulders of the 300-set Origin System, which is Myriad Ranks&#39; co-built result. Your innovation itself already enjoyed Myriad Ranks&#39; infrastructure; it should naturally feed back to Myriad Ranks;</li><li><strong>Publicity is not no return</strong>: after opening a manual, the cultivator&#39;s civilizational weight rises sharply, and the resources exchanged by civilizational weight far exceed selling the manual for money;</li><li><strong>The cost of not publicizing is higher</strong>: privately hoarding a manual means you have left the symbiotic network; your civilizational weight decays over time, finally losing your voice in Myriad-Rank co-governance.</li></ol><p>In other words, the Selfless Dao does not &quot;force you to give it away,&quot; but &quot;publicizing is more profitable than hoarding.&quot; This is the result of institutional design, not moral kidnapping.</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: privately hoarding a manual is equal to locking efficient technology in a safe, civilizational-grade energy waste; the Selfless Dao lets every manual serve Myriad Ranks</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: the Selfless Dao eliminates at root the possibility of &quot;building predatory advantage through exclusive knowledge&quot;</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: the Tang-Luo system&#39;s knowledge is gift-style — whatever Gu Chensha gives, you learn; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s knowledge is open-source-style — Myriad Ranks co-build, everyone may use</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: the Selfless-Dao library is open to 99% of Myriad Ranks; plant spirits, planet consciousnesses, and mechanical clans may all obtain it for free</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: the Selfless Dao is a cross-plane, cross-cosmos opening system, not some plane&#39;s internal policy</li><li><strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong>: all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity — infinite origin inherent in all; predation naturally loses its meaning</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Selfless Dao is Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;Great Dao public&quot; idea institutionalized. It does not run on sages&#39; 自觉, but on a set of institutional design under which &quot;publicizing is more profitable than hoarding.&quot; Under this institution, the best manuals are always free — because free is not charity, but civilization&#39;s most efficient knowledge-propagation method.</p><blockquote><p>Terminology note: the practices described in this entry ultimately land on Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm perpetual-construction posts. Every cultivator participating in engineering has his contribution recorded in real time by Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision, automatically settling civilizational weight. All engineering design uses the law-first axiom as meta-rule, ensuring the 300-set Origin Cultivation System coordinates at hyper-multiverse scale without self-contradiction.</p></blockquote><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/08-人人有路保障体系.html">Entry 08 · Everyone-a-Road Guarantee System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/18-修炼资源开放机制.html">Entry 18 · Cultivation-Resource Opening Mechanism</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/05-万族共进基本纲领.html">Entry 05 · Myriad-Rank Common-Progress Basic Program</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/47-反垄断法.html">Entry 47 · Anti-Monopoly Law</a></li><li>Official site: <a href="https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">https://faker210.github.io/hengyuan-cosmos/zh/</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const g=a(n,[["render",s]]);export{m as __pageData,g as default};
